\n\nWait, let\'s look at statement 18 again: If something is young and it visits the mouse, then it likes the cat.The bear is young (from earlier conclusion), so it visits the mouse (statement 5), so it likes the cat.The lion is definitely young.</think>.\n\nThe lion\'s age cannot be determined from the given information. Therefore, the option is']]  1%|1         | 6/600 [00:01<01:53,  5.22it/s]
