t being white (point 9), Erin is not white.Therefore, the statement "Erin is not white" is indeed true.\n\nI don\'t see any contradictions or missing information that would make this uncertain.So, I\'m confident that the answer is true.\n\n</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
