et me see if there\'s more context.\n\nFact 13: Red things are furry.So if something is red, it\'s furry.But Gary is red (fact 6), so Gary is furry.\n\nBut the question is about Harry, not Gary.So Harry is smart, kind, quiet, and blue (from fact 9, since he\'s quiet and smart).But wait, fact 12 says all blue and green things are smart.So being blue makes Harry smart, which we already know.\nHarry is not furry.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
