nkind? No, the rabbit\'s unkindness isn\'t directly tied to eating the dog unless statement 16 applies, which it does because the rabbit is not eating the dog, being eaten. But the rabbit is not chasing the cat, which makes the cat unkind (statement 12). Then, the cat being unkind makes it smooth (statement 15). So, the cat is smooth. Therefore, the statement "The cat is not rough" is true because the cat is smooth. </think>.. Therefore, the option is']] 12%|#1        | 70/600 [09:21<1:45:48, 11.98s/it]
