e\'s blue (from point 16).\n\nWait, but let me check if that\'s correct.Point 16 says if something is nice, it\'s blue.So yes, since Charlie is nice (because he\'s young), he must be blue.\n\nBut wait, the question is about Charlie being white.So if Charlie is blue, then he\'s not white.Charlie is white, so the statement that he\'s blue is true.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
