means Bob is not rough.So Bob is not rough.\nBased on the information provided, Bob is quiet, which confirms the statement "Bob is quiet" to be true.</think>.\n\nThe statement "Bob is not quiet" is true because Bob is kind, and from the given rules, being kind means he cannot be rough. Since being quiet implies roughness, Bob cannot be quiet. Therefore, the option is']]
