 nice, but being round should make her green. In conclusion, Fiona is not green, contrary to the question posed.\n</think>.\n\nThe statement "Fiona is not green" is false because Fiona is quiet, and according to the given rules, quiet things are green. Therefore, Fiona must be green. Therefore, the option is']]
