 Bob should be blue.\n\nWait, but let me check if there\'s any contradiction here.Let\'s see:\n\n- Bob is nice (point 3)\n- Bob is white (point 4)\n- White people are quiet (point 10)\n- So Bob is quiet\n- If someone is nice and quiet, they are blue (point 11)\n- Therefore, Bob is blue\nBased on the information provided, it seems Bob is indeed not blue, despite the initial indication that he is blue.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
