ntioned.So, we don\'t know if Fiona is kind or not.She could be kind or not.\n\nIf Fiona is kind, then from point 15, she would be white.But if she\'s not kind, then the statement about being kind and smart doesn\'t apply.However, we don\'t have any information about Fiona\'s kindness.\n\nNow, let\'s consider the coldness.Fiona\'s age is specified. She is young based on the information provided about Bob, Gary, and Harry. Therefore, it is certain that Fiona is young and not old or of unspecified age.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
