 are young.So if Fiona were smart, she would be young, which she already is.But we don't know if she's smart yet.\n\n- Rule 11 says young things are kind.Since Fiona is young, she must be kind.Wait, but point 2 says Bob is kind, and point 9 says if something is kind, it's green.So Bob is kind and green.But Fiona is kind too because she's young, so she must be kind.So the answer should be B) False.</think>.. Therefore, the option is"]]
