uiet.So that doesn\'t directly help.\n\nFrom point 4: Big, quiet people are not smart.So if someone is big and quiet, they can\'t be smart.But Erin is smart, so if she were big and quiet, that would contradict point 4.But we don\'t know if Erin is big or quiet.\n\nFrom point 5: Smart people are nice.Erin is smart, so she must be nice.But that doesn\'t tell us about her furiness.\n\nLooking at point 3: All quiet, furry people are green.Also, from point 2, all round people are green.So if someone is quiet and furry, they\'re green, and if they\'re round, they\'re green.But again, this doesn\'t directly relate to Erin.\n\nPoint 6: If Anne is big and green, then she is round.But we don\'t know if Anne is big.From the given, Anne is furry and nice.But we don\'t know if she\'s big or quiet.From point 4, big, quiet people aren\'t smart, but Anne is nice, so maybe she\'s not big?Or maybe she is, but we don\'t know.\n\nWait, let\'s think about Anne.She\'s furry and nice.From point 4, big, quiet people aren\'t smart.But Anne is nice, so if she were big and quiet, she wouldn\'t be smart, but she is nice.That doesn\'t necessarily mean she\'s not big or quiet.It\'s possible she\'s big and quiet but still nice, but that seems contradictory because if she\'s big and quiet, she wouldn\'t be smart, but being nice doesn\'t depend on being smart.Hmm, maybe she\'s not big or quiet.\n\nBut I\'m not sure.Let\'s see if there\'s any other connection.From point 1, Anne is furry, so from point 3, all quiet, furry people are green.So if Anne is quiet, she\'s green.But we don\'t know if she\'s quiet.From point 2, all round people are green.So if Anne is round, she\'s green.But from point 6, if she\'s big and green, she\'s round.But we don\'t know if she\'s big.Based on the information provided, it is clear that Erin is furry.</think>.\n\nThe statement "Erin is not furry" is unknown because there is no information provided about Erin\'s furiness. The given facts only mention other individuals and their traits without any direct or indirect reference to Erin\'s furiness. Therefore, the option is']]
