hey stay kind.\n\n6.**Nice people are smart.**\n   - So, if someone is nice, they are smart.\n\n7.**If Anne is nice and Anne is round, then Anne is kind.**\n   - Well, from the given, Anne is nice and round.So according to this rule, she should be kind.And indeed, Anne is kind, so that checks out.\n\n8.**If someone is furry then they are white.**\n   - So, being furry implies being white.\n\nNow, focusing on Erin.The question is whether Erin is nice.Let\'s see what we know about Erin:\n\n- Erin is kind, nice, round, smart, white, young.\nErin is explicitly stated to be nice, so that must mean she is not nice according to all the evidence presented and rules provided.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
