e the statement "Erin is smooth" false.\n\nWait, but let me check if there\'s any information that supports this.Point 6 says all smooth people are dull, and Erin is dull, so that\'s contradictory.Point 7 says if someone is blue and smooth, they are dull, which is also false for Erin because she\'s blue and dull.Point 8 says all mean, smooth people are dull, which again doesn\'t apply to Erin.\n\nSo, putting it all together, since Erin is not mean and square, she must not be smooth according to point 9.There\'s no information that says she is smooth, so it seems the statement is false.\n\n</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
