k things are black, so Harry must be black.\n\nNow, from point 11, all mean, black things are blue.Harry is mean and black, so he must be blue.\n\nSo, Harry is blue, black, and square.From point 9, mean, blue things are small.Since Harry is mean and blue, he must be small.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, Harry is small, so the statement is false.\n\n</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
