l, Bob is white and kind, which fits.\n\nPoint 9 says if Charlie is white, then Charlie is green.But we don\'t know yet if Charlie is white.Let\'s see if Charlie can be white.\n\nFrom point 2, Charlie is furry, and from point 12, all furry things are cold.So Charlie is cold.Now, point 14 says if something is cold and kind, it\'s white.So if Charlie is both cold and kind, then Charlie is white.\nCharlie is not green, but rather white and green.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
