 cold → Harry is rough\nRule 4: Rough → Quiet\nRule 5: Quiet → Round\nRule 6: Kind ∧ Cold → Quiet\nRule 7: Round → Rough\nRule 8: Cold → Nice\nAnne is not rough.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
