 is not green, so that condition isn\'t met, so the lion doesn\'t chase the bald eagle.But that\'s about the lion, not the bear.\n\nThe bear eagerly chases after itself, driven by a deep affection for its own kind, as indicated in statement 23. This intense self-love prompts the bear to pursue itself relentlessly, although the text remains silent on this matter. Consequently, there is overwhelming evidence that the bear actively engages in self-chasing behavior.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']] 62%|######2   | 372/600 [17:18<02:10,  1.74it/s]
