g information.\n\nPoint 13 says all young people are kind.Point 5 says Charlie is young, so Charlie is kind.Point 7 says Erin is kind.So that\'s consistent.The statement "Erin is not kind" is true because Erin is kind.</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
