formation, Charlie is not blue, not red.So, is there any information that would suggest Charlie is red?Let\'s check.\n\nPoint 1 doesn\'t say Anne is red, but that says something about Charlie.Points 2,3,4 are not about Bob, who is not big, not green, and not red.Points 6 and 7 are not about Dave, who is not big and not blue.So, the only thing we can\'t conclude about Charlie is that he\'s not blue, not red.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Charlie is red" is true.\n\n</think>.. Therefore, the option is']]
