in that Harry is not big, as being furry does not necessarily imply being big.Therefore, we can confidently say that Harry is not big based on his fur alone.</think>.\n\nThe statement "Harry is big" is unknown because the given information doesn\'t confirm Harry\'s size. Harry is known to be furry, white, young, and nice, but there\'s no evidence that he is big. Therefore, the option is']]
