s round and quiet, then it\'s green.So, Gary is round and quiet, which makes him green.From the details provided, it\'s clear that Gary is old and loud, and there\'s no doubt about it.</think>.\n\nThe statement "Gary is young" is unknown because we don\'t have enough information to confirm or deny it. Gary is known to be round and kind, but without knowing if he\'s red, we can\'t apply the rule that red, round things are young. Thus, we can\'t determine his youth. Therefore, the option is']]
